      "text": "水下感情失了灯"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 1,
      "start_ms": 26019,
      "end_ms": 31300,
      "text": "回望这一段人生梦境"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 2,
      "start_ms": 31300,
      "end_ms": 35080,
      "text": "今天今天这事多转变"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 3,
      "start_ms": 35080,
      "end_ms": 38400,
      "text": "你都也一意跟我共行"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 4,
      "start_ms": 39520,
      "end_ms": 47339,
      "text": "曾在我的失意天回民究竟为何心"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 5,
      "start_ms": 48520,
      "end_ms": 55580,
      "text": "但你开始我但喜欢我勇敢去面迎人生"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 6,
      "start_ms": 57200,
      "end_ms": 62430,
      "text": "让我可再会多回一次"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 7,
      "start_ms": 62430,
      "end_ms": 65920,
      "text": "都盼再可惜"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 8,
      "start_ms": 66380,
      "end_ms": 74660,
      "text": "在老头重逢着你共去写一生的句子"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 9,
      "start_ms": 74660,
      "end_ms": 81420,
      "text": "让我可再会做过一次清楚"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 10,
      "start_ms": 82740,
      "end_ms": 88480,
      "text": "我都怕面前仍然是你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 11,
      "start_ms": 88960,
      "end_ms": 95940,
      "text": "我要他生都有今生的暖意"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 12,
      "start_ms": 98600,
      "end_ms": 102540,
      "text": "梦什么好给你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 13,
      "start_ms": 102540,
      "end_ms": 106119,
      "text": "但求凭这阙歌"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 14,
      "start_ms": 107560,
      "end_ms": 113270,
      "text": "这这里风雨落都不退"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 15,
      "start_ms": 113270,
      "end_ms": 114500,
      "text": "愿陪着我"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 16,
      "start_ms": 116660,
      "end_ms": 120540,
      "text": "在别今天的你"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 17,
      "start_ms": 120540,
      "end_ms": 124259,
      "text": "但求凭我爱火"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 18,
      "start_ms": 125460,
      "end_ms": 129300,
      "text": "活在你心内"
    },
    {
      "ordinal": 19,
